WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hi, I’m Dr. Aditya Soni, a psychiatrist. Are you constantly overthinking, feeling anxious, having intrusive thoughts, low mood, OCD symptoms, or sleep problems?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Does your mind keep thinking continuously? If so, you should seek some help.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
That’s why I have created a simple mental health screening questionnaire.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
It’s a questionnaire, and the link is in my bio. By answering it, you can understand your mental health better.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:47.000
This is not a diagnostic questionnaire. It won’t diagnose any illness, but it can indicate whether this is simply a normal life pattern or if you may need professional help.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:17.000
This quiz is only meant to guide you as a first step. It has no diagnostic purpose. If, at the end of the quiz, it suggests that you may need professional help,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.120
then please consider seeking professional guidance.
